---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="About A Sheila Bruce Affair | Florida Gulf Coast Events">
  <section class="hero">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">About the brand</p><h1>Luxury, sisterhood, wellness & celebration.</h1><p class="lead">{site.descriptor}</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/events">View Past Affairs</a><a class="btn secondary" href="/contact?intent=host_event_inquiry">Have Sheila Host an Event</a></div></div>
    <div class="hero-card contain-media logo-hero-card"><img src="/assets/logos/sheila-logo.png" alt="A Sheila Bruce Affair logo"></div>
  </section>
  <section><div class="section-title"><h2>The affairs we create.</h2><p class="lead">A Sheila Bruce Affair brings together polished hospitality, culture, wellness, sisterhood, and joy.</p></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Signature Boat & Yacht Experiences</h3><p>White parties, champagne moments, DJ-led afternoons, and stylish gatherings by the water.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Formal Balls & Galas</h3><p>Elegant evenings, black-tie glamour, dinner, dancing, and fabulous company.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Wellness & Empowerment</h3><p>Women-centered conversations around health, wealth, leadership, confidence, and meaningful connection.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Dinners & Cocktail Gatherings</h3><p>Intimate rooms for conversation, celebration, and community connection.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Private Affairs</h3><p>Custom hosted moments for friends, couples, professional circles, birthdays, and community groups.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Seasonal Socials</h3><p>Gulf Coast happy hours, soirées, and stylish reasons to gather beautifully.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="dark"><div class="section-title"><h2>Who gathers here.</h2></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Black women and friends</h3><p>Women supporting women, beautifully — with room for friends and community members to gather with intention.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Couples and professionals</h3><p>Stylish social circles, accomplished women, community leaders, and people who still love to show up well.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Retirees and Gulf Coast neighbors</h3><p>Connection, culture, wellness, joy, and elevated living across Sarasota and surrounding communities.</p></div></div></section>
  <section><div class="split"><div><p class="script">Florida Gulf Coast</p><h2>Rooted in Sarasota style.</h2><p class="lead">The brand is shaped by the rhythm of Sarasota, Venice, Palmetto, and the surrounding Gulf Coast: coastal beauty, dining, culture, water, wellness, and community.</p><p>From marina departures to elegant dinners and community conversations, the setting matters. A Sheila Bruce Affair brings Gulf Coast warmth into every room and every experience.</p></div><div class="portrait"><img src="/assets/sarasota/sarasota-gulf-coast-yacht.jpg" alt="Sarasota Gulf Coast yacht and water view"></div></div></section>
  <section class="dark"><div class="split"><div><p class="script">From Sisters of Sarasota</p><h2>To A Sheila Bruce Affair</h2><p class="lead">Before A Sheila Bruce Affair, Sheila began bringing women together through Sisters of Sarasota, creating space for friendship, conversation, sisterhood, and joy.</p><p>That origin remains part of the brand’s spirit, while the work has grown into a luxury lifestyle and event brand for social gatherings, wellness conversations, empowerment experiences, and unforgettable celebrations.</p><a class="btn" href="/sheila">Meet Sheila</a></div><div class="portrait"><img src="/assets/brand/sheila/sheila-boat-white.jpg" alt="Sheila Bruce hosting on a boat"></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
